# LigerLearn's own Calendly event type, used by the inline booking widget on
# /learn (#conversation) and the secondary "Book a 30-minute conversation"
# links on /learn/one-force.
#
# This must be created in Calendly first (it is a separate event type from
# LigerForce's, which already exists at
# https://calendly.com/obafemi-oshinowo-ligerforce/30min) — do not reuse that
# URL. Once created, set this to the new event's booking URL, e.g.
# https://calendly.com/<your-handle>/30min, in Vercel (Production + Preview).
# Left unset, the LigerLearn pages fall back to a plain confirmation message
# and hide the Calendly links — nothing breaks.
NEXT_PUBLIC_LIGERLEARN_CALENDLY_URL=
